<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Medarex rated attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Medarex rated attractive.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vector Securities International said Wednesday it reinstated coverage of Medarex Inc with an attractive rating and a price target of $9 a share.</p>
<p>-- Medarex shares were up 5/16 at 6-7/8.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
